<h2 class="doc-h2">Link</h2>
<p class="doc-note">
    One target and one focus stop. A row with a link <i>inside</i> it gives you a small target and
    two tab stops, which is the version people build by accident.
</p>
<Example Source="ItemLink.razor"><ItemLink /></Example>

<h2 class="doc-h2">Dropdown</h2>
<p class="doc-note">
    The row is not a link here: a link with a menu inside it is a link you cannot open without
    hitting the menu by accident.
</p>
